-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
PLACEHOLDER: The repository owner must generate a real RSA-4096 or EC-P384
key pair offline and replace this file with the actual public key PEM.

Generation instructions (run offline, not on the agent host):
  openssl genpkey -algorithm EC -pkeyopt ec_paramgen_curve:P-384 \
    -out custodian_private.pem
  openssl pkey -pubout -in custodian_private.pem \
    -out custodian_public_key.pem

IMPORTANT:
- custodian_private.pem must NEVER be committed to version control.
- custodian_private.pem must be stored in a location inaccessible to
  any agent or evaluator process (password manager, encrypted offline
  storage, or sealed physical envelope).
- Only this file (custodian_public_key.pem) is committed to the repo.
- The blinding.py symmetric implementation uses the seed directly for
  encryption; this file documents the asymmetric alternative for full
  compliance with R05 once the cryptography package is available.
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
